Job Description M/B Partners is seeking a Director of Operations on behalf of a client in the Greater Chicago area to lead manufacturing and supply chain for its two business divisions. Reporting to the President, this dynamic leadership role will be responsible for the following: 

 Operations leadership and execution; 
 Supply chain and inventory; 
 Safety, quality and reliability; 
 Manufacturing engineering and continuous improvement; 
 ERP, and; 
 People and financial performance. …

